# NOT READ BY FLAKE8 — kept only so this filename cannot mislead again.
#
# flake8 has no `.flake8ignore` concept. It reads `exclude =` from `.flake8`
# (or setup.cfg / tox.ini). This file was added alongside #17740 intending to
# exclude the vendored MCP server, but because nothing reads it the exclusion
# silently did nothing and `main` went red on the flake8 baseline gate with 33
# new findings.
#
# The real exclusion now lives in `.flake8` under `exclude =`.
# `tests/python-flake8-workflow.test.js` asserts every path listed here is also
# excluded there, so this file can never again look effective while doing
# nothing. Add paths to `.flake8` first; list them here only to mirror it.
#
mcp-servers/gemini-notebook-mcp-cli
